            "John the Baptist pointed to Jesus and said, \"Behold, the Lamb of God, who takes away the sin of the world\" (John 1:29). Paul calls Christ \"our Passover lamb\" (1 Corinthians 5:7). Ephesians 1:7 and Colossians 1:13-14 say we have redemption, forgiveness, and a transfer from the kingdom of darkness into the kingdom of the Son. Notice the tense: we have it now, not only in the future.",
